<title>USA: Algeria seeks 20,000T sunseed oil- U.S. exporters.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 20,000T sunseed oil- U.S. exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria is expected to tender for 20,000 tonnes of sunflowerseed oil over the weekend, for May shipment, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's very possible they could take U.S. because we've got some good stocks,&quot; a U.S. vegetable oil exporter said.</p>
<p>Another exporter said the sunflowerseed oil would most likely come from South America.</p>
<p>((Anna Driver 312-983-7294)</p>
</text>
